SCAPT.IMG

Screen dumps in PCX format to PC.

Place in root directory of Psion M drive. Connect and raise the 3-link
to the PC. Go to the Psion screen you want dumped. On the PC screen, type
RUN SCAPT (or RUN SCAPT.IMG? - I forget). PCX file SCREEN.PCX is made in
current directory on PC, Series 3 beeps when complete.


